Very funny. You can be a noob and copy a bot design, or take hours pimpin' your ride to make it more powerful. Since you got a "minecraft-ish" freedom, you can make either an excellent design, or a big pile of garbage. It's very cool, just play it. You can do it for free, with free parts and such.
But, some cons:
* You can have level 3-4 weapons in level 1 fights;
* It's easy to have OP campers;
* People is not very team-friendly, rendering the "challenge fight" almost impossible;
* Building UI is clumbersome sometimes
Those are annoying, but does not ruin the experience.

It is a game where the sequence surpasses the first game. Portal 2 is way more fun! This game is mandatory, everyone should play it once in their lives. Worth it!
Pros:
- Great graphics;
- Excellent soundtrack;
- Interesting plot with great characters;
- Challenging puzzles;
- Amazing cooperative mode;
Cons:
- Very addictive;
- Occasional dizziness (depending on you gameplay);

